WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.640
The Argument tab draws your essay as one line through its paragraphs,

1.2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.681
labelled by what each one does.

2.1
00:00:07.481 --> 00:00:10.614
Arcs join paragraphs that support or answer each other.

3.1
00:00:10.814 --> 00:00:13.351
The line drifts where a paragraph strays from your thesis,

3.2
00:00:13.351 --> 00:00:15.889
and breaks where a step is missing.
